# Fork additions. Everything above is upstream's own ignore list, kept intact:
# MPFR ships no .gitignore entries for a Zig build, so the two directories the
# Zig build system creates at the repository root are added here rather than in
# a separate file, because a second ignore file at the root is not possible and
# a local exclude would not travel with the repository. Both are also absent
# from the .paths allowlist in build.zig.zon, so a normal user build cannot
# change the package hash. Recorded as FORK-NOTES entry 11.
/.zig-cache/
/zig-out/

# Additive, for the same reason as the two entries above: `nix build` leaves a
# `result` symlink at the repository root, and `devenv`/direnv create their
# state beside it. None of these is part of the package, so none is in the
# `.paths` allowlist in build.zig.zon either. Upstream's own entries above are
# untouched; this file may only grow.
/result
/.devenv*
/.direnv*
zig-pkg/
